<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Hej, Sloveni (Samo Tomášik), later the Pan-Slavic anthem and the anthem of Yugoslavia and of Serbia and Montenegro</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1848 (the year of revolutions)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody, slowed</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Shche ne vmerla Ukraina (anthem of Ukraine)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">lyrics influenced by it</span></li><li><a href="/songs/hatikvah">Hatikvah</a><span class="sg-chain-h">named as inspired by it</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Croatia has not yet fallen (Croatian reveille)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">named as inspired by it</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Marsz Polonii</span><span class="sg-chain-h">variant among Polish emigrants in the Americas</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Fugue on &quot;Jeszcze Polska nie zginęła&quot; (Karol Kurpiński)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1821</span><span class="sg-chain-h">fugue on the melody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Kłótnia przez zakład, overture (Karol Lipiński)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">c. 1812</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Piano arrangement (Wojciech Sowiński)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1829</span><span class="sg-chain-h">arrangement</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Polonia Overture (Richard Wagner)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Der Pole und sein Kind (Albert Lortzing)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Symphony in B minor &quot;Polonia&quot; (Ignacy Jan Paderewski)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1908</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Polonia (Edward Elgar)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1915</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in</span></li><li><a href="/songs/hey-slavs">Hey, Slavs</a> <span class="sg-chain-y">1834</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody</span></li><li><a href="/songs/national-anthem-of-ukraine">State Anthem of Ukraine</a> <span class="sg-chain-y">1862</span><span class="sg-chain-h">influence on the words, as scholars think</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired-by"><h2>What it drew on</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Polish folk mazurka (unidentified)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">second half of the 18th century</span><span class="sg-chain-h">melody probably adapted from it</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="sg-sec"><h2>People, places and events</h2><div class="tih-tags"><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Józef Wybicki</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Jan Henryk Dąbrowski</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Napoleon Bonaparte</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Stefan Czarniecki</span><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tadeusz-kosciuszko">Tadeusz Kościuszko</a><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Hugo Kołłątaj</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Tadeusz Czacki</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Adam Mickiewicz</span><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jozef-poniatowski">Józef Poniatowski</a><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Michał Kleofas Ogiński</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Karol Kurpiński</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Kazimierz Sikorski</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Artur Rubinstein</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Aleksander Kwaśniewski</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Samo Tomášik</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Edward Rożnowski</span><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/reggio-emilia">Reggio Emilia</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/milan">Milan</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bologna">Bologna</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/poznan">Poznań</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/warsaw">Warsaw</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/krakow">Kraków</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/paris">Paris</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/berlin">Berlin</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/san-francisco">San Francisco</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/third-partition-of-poland">Third Partition of Poland</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kosciuszko-uprising">Kościuszko Uprising</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/french-revolutionary-wars">French Revolutionary Wars</a><sp